[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":96},["ShallowReactive",2],{"blog:archive:4":3},{"posts":4,"total":86,"tags":87,"tag":-1},[5,14,23,31,37,46,54,62,70,78],{"title":6,"link":7,"date":8,"dateTime":9,"description":10,"thumbnail":11,"tags":12},"六角 Discord 討論王","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-02-22-hex-discord-king","2022\u002F02\u002F22","2022-02-22","在 Discord 的討論頻道中，同學可以針對課程中的任何資源及知識進行討論，甚至也會不藏私地把自己的心得筆記分享給大家，在六角 Discord 頻道中，你可以透過「發言」的方式提升等級，每當升級時系統會給予提示，並給予額外的獎勵稱號。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F02%2F22%2FUntitled.png?alt=media&token=f18d1462-348b-44cd-8d74-bc3c631ff640",[13],"event",{"title":15,"link":16,"date":17,"dateTime":18,"description":19,"thumbnail":20,"tags":21},"【4月開班】Node.js 後端工程師養成直播班","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-02-17-node-training-intro","2022\u002F02\u002F17","2022-02-17","Node.js 後端工程師養成直播班，即將在 2022 年 4 月開班。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F02%2F17%2Fa39fc1cfe9ead6c7-1.png?alt=media&token=124d8724-cfa5-494d-8896-53f76ca041f9",[22],"course",{"title":24,"link":25,"date":26,"dateTime":27,"description":28,"thumbnail":29,"tags":30},"JavaScript 組合包介紹","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-01-14-js-course-intro","2022\u002F01\u002F14","2022-01-14","我們是六角學院，到了現在已經培育出許多網頁開發者並成功進入業界，「JavaScript 組合」特別推薦給想深入了解 JS 觀念與應用的開發者。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-courses.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fhex-website%2Fblog%2F1718099271466-JS%20%E8%AA%B2%E7%A8%8B%E7%B5%84%E5%90%88%E5%8C%85n.png?alt=media&token=459926ca-9d34-4117-af3b-054d65504a5f",[22],{"title":32,"link":33,"date":26,"dateTime":27,"description":34,"thumbnail":35,"tags":36},"網頁設計組合包介紹","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-01-14-web-layout-intro","我們是六角學院，到了現在已經培育出許多網頁開發者並成功進入業界，「網頁設計組合」特別推薦給對於網頁開發有興趣的新人。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2023%2F03%2FFB1200-628.png?alt=media&token=90d29806-d299-412b-b366-5d0539f2b219",[22],{"title":38,"link":39,"date":40,"dateTime":41,"description":42,"thumbnail":43,"tags":44},"想要轉職前端工程師？業務背景也能轉職成前端工程師！","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-01-05-sales-to-frontend","2022\u002F01\u002F05","2022-01-05","從事業務約八年的 AWEI，做得有點疲乏，決定轉往前端領域看看。在其他人眼中他就是有很多問題的問題兒童，他想要告訴我們：「不要害怕問問題，程式不會就是不會！」AWEI 花了八個月學習，終於成功轉職為前端工程師！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F01%2FBlog-08.png?alt=media&token=c08fef46-2595-4c9e-b2ee-d785a2b9b837",[45],"interview",{"title":47,"link":48,"date":49,"dateTime":50,"description":51,"thumbnail":52,"tags":53},"業務轉職前端工程師！跟著六角一起勇往直前","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-12-23-alec-to-frontend","2021\u002F12\u002F23","2021-12-23","非本科系畢業的 Alec，三十歲以前做過的工作都不太長久，直到接觸了前端，在學習的過程中堅定自己的信念，終於轉職成為前端工程師！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2021%2F12%2F21%2FBlog-06.png?alt=media&token=0d142a85-d047-45b1-bdcf-8329b42927c3",[45],{"title":55,"link":56,"date":57,"dateTime":58,"description":59,"thumbnail":60,"tags":61},"【轉職前端工程師】學習前端，年齡不是問題","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-12-22-every-age-learn-frontend","2021\u002F12\u002F22","2021-12-22","35 歲才決定轉職，真的可以做到嗎？如果你抱持著自己三四十歲就必須要很厲害的心態，當然會覺得年紀是個問題。但是宇宏想要告訴你，只要你覺得沒有問題，那就是沒有問題！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2021%2F12%2F21%2FBlog-05.png?alt=media&token=15965e37-994e-4cf2-89ef-ce3fa688358d",[45],{"title":63,"link":64,"date":65,"dateTime":66,"description":67,"thumbnail":68,"tags":69},"註冊六角課程，到底包含了哪些福利","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-12-21-hex-service","2021\u002F12\u002F21","2021-12-21","六角經營至今已經有上萬人加入，隨著時間前進我們也不斷地加入新的內容，這篇來重新介紹六角的課程到底有哪些額外的延伸內容吧！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fversion_2019%2F2023%2Flanding-2023-list.png?alt=media&token=aad511ea-50b9-4074-a5b8-5e4dd1f4a016",[13],{"title":